    "type": "cexolocstring",
    "value": {
      "0": "The one who carries it finds their skin hardened against the bite of flame and the sting of iron alike. This belt, taken from the chambers of Saruman, offers a formidable barrier against the harshest of impacts. Its blackened plates remain cold even in the heat of battle."
